stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle: Server Ready

    Idle --> Validating: POST /api/generations
    Validating --> Queued: Schema Validated
    Validating --> Idle: Validation Error (422)

    Queued --> LoadingModel: Worker Picked Job
    LoadingModel --> EncodingPrompt: Model Ready in VRAM
    EncodingPrompt --> Generating: Condition Tensor [B, 32, 4096]

    Generating --> Decoding: Flow Matching Completed
    Generating --> Cancelling: POST /cancel
    
    Decoding --> Retargeting: Latent Output Decoded
    Decoding --> Cancelling: POST /cancel

    Retargeting --> Completed: VRM 1.0 Payload Built
    
    Cancelling --> Cancelled: Resources Cleaned Up
    Cancelled --> Idle: Acknowledge Cancel

    Generating --> Error: CUDA / Model Exception
    Decoding --> Error: Numerical Instability
    Retargeting --> Error: Malformed Joints
    
    Error --> Idle: Log Error & Report
    Completed --> Playing: Frontend Loads Payload
    Playing --> Idle: Playback Finished / Paused
